<title>DUBAI: GOLF-SCORES IN DUBAI CREEK OPEN GOLF TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES IN DUBAI CREEK OPEN GOLF TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading second round scores in the</p>
<p>Dubai Creek Open golf tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>139 Jeev Milkha Singh (India) 71 68, Choi Kyung-ju</p>
<p>(South Korea) 70 69, Paul Friedlander (Swaziland) 69 70</p>
<p>140 Peter Fowler (Australia) 70 70, Kyi Hia Han (Burma)</p>
<p>68 72</p>
<p>141 Greg Hanrahan (U.S.) 75 66, John Kernohan (U.S.) 71 70,</p>
<p>Mardan Mamat (Singapore) 70 71, Kim Wan-tae (South Korea)</p>
<p>69 72</p>
<p>142 Gerry Norquist (U.S.) 73 69, Rafael Ponce (Ecuador) 71 71</p>
</text>
